# Browser
# Intimidation Tactics: "You choose an artifact or creature card from it. Exile that card." The question Bot1's page asks is
# about exiling - the dock reads "exile" and offers "Exile", never "Discard" - and says which kind of card the choice
# is of, as the card words it ("an artifact or creature card"; Bot2's hand is Llanowar Elves, a Lightning Bolt and five
# Islands), where it once read "choose a card to discard / Discard it" (the purpose was the one a discard from a revealed
# hand has).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Intimidation Tactics
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Intimidation Tactics.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Intimidation Tactics: choose an artifact or creature card to exile
? Client.Bot1.Button.Exile = shown
? Client.Bot1.Button.Discard = absent
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Intimidation Tactics
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
